        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) Change of Status Due to Inability to Complete Program—If the unit member cannot complete the planned program during the period for which leave for improvement was granted, it is his/her responsibility to notify the superintendent. The leave may then be rescinded by the Board of Education and the unit member placed on the appropriate leave status, reassigned, or terminated.",
